GIXSQL         BY VALUE 16
GIXSQL         BY VALUE 1
GIXSQL         BY VALUE 0
GIXSQL         BY VALUE 0
GIXSQL         BY REFERENCE HV-ASI-TIPOAFEC
GIXSQL         BY REFERENCE 0
GIXSQL     END-CALL
